WEBVTT

00:14:57.026 --> 00:15:01.097
We shouldn't have to worry about whether
or not we can afford our insulin.

00:15:03.199 --> 00:15:06.402
Because I want to eat that frosty.

00:15:06.869 --> 00:15:09.605
And have to worry about only one price.

00:15:11.574 --> 00:15:12.875
That headache?

00:15:13.342 --> 00:15:16.045
That's sometimes worth it.

00:15:17.513 --> 00:15:18.781
Thank you.

00:15:18.815 --> 00:15:20.983
(Applause)